  "_note": "The question the before/after table cannot answer on its own: is the movement the parser, or did something else in the flip commits move a number? Answered by re-measuring the OLD parser from the NEW tree -- runall's own `run_lane` with `baseline=None`, so the same conversion, the same batch render, the same harness.evaluate and the same `gate.record`, with only the gate comparison skipped -- and diffing that against testkit/gate_baseline.json metric by metric.",
